{"updated":"2026-11-23T13:48:23.745Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Flights and train services cancelled in Belgium due to strike. Elsewhere, DW. And mexican soldiers attacked in wake of drug lord's arrest. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 10.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 8.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 14.4 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 49 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.5 near Vanuatu region. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.34,0.38,0.42,0.46,0.5,0.53,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.79,0.88,1.03,1.42,1.53,1.58,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.71,1.73,1.75,1.8,1.85,1.92,1.97,2.02,2.06,2.09,2.14,2.17,2.21,2.26,2.31,2.35,2.38,2.43,2.47,2.52,2.57,2.61,2.67,2.73,2.79,2.9,3,3.15,3.17,3.22,3.24,3.3,3.34,3.4,3.52,3.61,3.67,3.74,3.79,3.84,3.89,3.94,3.98,4,4.03,4.08,4.1,4.12,4.14,4.19,4.24,4.32,4.38,4.45,4.5,4.56,4.62,4.66,4.71,4.74,4.79,4.91,5.04,5.21,5.72,5.8,5.88,5.93,5.97,6,6.06,6.12,6.15,6.19,6.21,6.25,6.29,6.34,6.4,6.44,6.5,6.54,6.62,6.66,6.72,6.77,6.82,6.87,6.93,7.05,7.09,7.16,7.22,7.34,7.41,7.46,7.54,7.56,7.58,7.63,7.65,7.69,7.72,7.75,7.83,7.87,7.95,8.02,8.08,8.13,8.17,8.26,8.5,8.59,8.68,8.72,8.75,8.79,8.82,8.89,8.94,9,9.08,9.2,9.27,9.42,9.46,9.71,9.82,9.88,9.94,9.98,10.03,10.08,10.12,10.18,10.26,10.31,10.39,10.51,11.02,11.19,11.58,11.64,11.69,11.73,11.82,11.87,11.94,12.01,12.07,12.12,12.19,12.23,12.31,12.35,12.44,12.48,12.52,12.55,12.59,12.62,12.68,12.74,12.81,12.86,12.93,13.05,13.1,13.13,13.18,13.21,13.42,13.51,13.57,13.64,13.68,13.77,13.83,13.87,13.9,13.92,13.94,14,14.05,14.1,14.16,14.22,14.28,14.33,14.38,14.43,14.48,14.51,14.54,14.57,14.62,14.66,14.73,14.85,14.92